{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Tcp.Segment</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"tcpip","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Tcp","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Segment","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>TCP segments</p>","content":"<p>The receive queue stores out-of-order segments, and can coalesece them on input and pass on an ordered list up the stack to the application.</p><p>It also looks for control messages and dispatches them to the Rtx queue to ack messages or close channels.</p><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Rx\"><a href=\"#module-Rx\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Rx/index.html\">Rx</a></span><span> (<a href=\"Rx/argument-1-ACK/index.html\">ACK</a> : <a href=\"../Ack/module-type-M/index.html\">Ack.M</a>) : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-tx_flags\"><a href=\"#type-tx_flags\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> tx_flags</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-tx_flags.No_flags\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-tx_flags.No_flags\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">No_flags</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-tx_flags.Syn\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-tx_flags.Syn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Syn</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-tx_flags.Fin\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-tx_flags.Fin\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Fin</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-tx_flags.Rst\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-tx_flags.Rst\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Rst</span></span></code></li><li id=\"type-tx_flags.Psh\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-tx_flags.Psh\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Psh</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Either Syn/Fin/Rst allowed, but not combinations</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Tx\"><a href=\"#module-Tx\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Tx/index.html\">Tx</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Pre-transmission queue</p></div></div>"}